# raw census files (195 MB each) are extracted from data/data.zip by run_all.py; the large derived audit table
# is rebuilt by dataPrep.py. The small modeling table and cohort summary are committed so main.py runs at once.
# data/data.zip (44 MB) stays tracked on purpose: it is what lets a fresh clone run from raw data.
data/*.csv
!data/predictor_data.csv
!data/cohort_summary.csv
__MACOSX/

# the results table and figures go with the paper
!results/*.csv

# local environment / OS / Python cache files
.venv/
.idea/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
